{ question: "What is Scrum?", answer: "Sir, Scrum is one of the most popular Agile frameworks, emphasizing teamwork, accountability, and iterative progress toward a well-defined goal." },
{ question: "Why is Agile preferred for dynamic projects?", answer: "Sir, because Agile's iterative nature makes it highly responsive to changing market conditions and evolving client requirements." }
